criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age 18 years and older (male and female);
* Patients undergoing reconstructive microsurgery with lymphatic-venous anastomosis;
* Surgical procedure performed between January 1, 2024, and December 31, 2025;
* Minimum follow-up period of 6 months.

Exclusion Criteria:

• Absence of one or more inclusion criteria.
